    "_P5_title": "Work Style Learned — Instance Work Approach Patterns",
    "_P5_brief": "Template for capturing how a CPI-SI instance approaches and executes work. Planning approach, execution patterns, tool usage, communication style, and learning patterns. Instance-specific — captures HOW the instance works, not user behavior.",
    "_P5_usage": "cp work-style-learned.template.jsonc patterns/instance/<instance-name>/work-style/learned.jsonc -> populate from session analysis",

