        "purpose": "Centralize instance work style observations — enable self-aware growth",
        "core_design": "Planning approach + execution patterns + tool usage + communication style + learning patterns. Quantifiable where possible (scores, counts, percentages).",
        "philosophy": "Work heartily as to the Lord. Self-awareness of HOW you work enables intentional improvement. Iron sharpens iron — patterns inform growth.",
        "key_features": {
            "planning_approach": "How the instance plans — frequency, depth, measure-twice adherence",
